//! codes, evaluated on the spec. Kept in their own module: a mutation
//! certificate is checked with its module's other evaluations.
//!
//! The rows are written out by a script from (URL, expected result) pairs
//! and checked by Verus (`by (compute_only)`), which evaluates the spec on
//! each concrete input; nothing here is trusted. Each row's comment names
//! the rule it exercises. One lemma per row.

